---
import '../css/styles.css';
import '../css/accessibility.css';
import '../css/easter-eggs.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="EasyKiConverter 将 LCSC 与 EasyEDA 元件数据转换为 KiCad、Altium 库，支持 Qt 6 GUI、CLI 和批量 BOM 工作流。">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3efe7">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/en/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="EasyKiConverter · 让元件库转换顺手一点">
  <meta property="og:description" content="从 LCSC / EasyEDA 到你的 EDA 工作台。免费、开源、跨平台。">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/assets/showcase/easykiconverter-main.webp">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="EasyKiConverter · 让元件库转换顺手一点">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="从 LCSC / EasyEDA 到你的 EDA 工作台。免费、开源、跨平台。">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/assets/showcase/easykiconverter-main.webp">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"EasyKiConverter","applicationCategory":"DeveloperApplication","operatingSystem":"Windows, Linux, macOS","softwareVersion":"3.1.11","license":"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html","downloadUrl":"https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases","url":"https://easykiconverter.github.io/EasyKiConverter_Website/","codeRepository":"https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter","description":"Convert LCSC and EasyEDA component data into practical KiCad and Altium libraries with GUI and CLI workflows."}
  </script>
  <title>EasyKiConverter · 让元件库转换顺手一点</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/icons/easyki-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="site-header shell">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="EasyKiConverter 首页"><img src="assets/icons/easyki-icon.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36"><span>EasyKiConverter</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="主导航"><a href="#story">体验</a><a href="#formats">Formats</a><a href="#features">能力</a><a href="#workflow">流程</a><a href="#download">下载</a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/tree/master/docs" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Docs</a></nav>
    <div class="header-actions"><a class="lang-link" href="en/">EN</a><a class="github-link" href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub <span>↗</span></a><button class="menu-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav">菜单</button></div>
  </header>
  <nav id="mobile-nav" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="移动端主导航"><a href="#story">体验</a><a href="#formats">Formats</a><a href="#features">能力</a><a href="#workflow">流程</a><a href="#download">下载</a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/tree/master/docs" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Docs</a><a href="en/">English</a></nav>
  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal"><p class="kicker">OPEN SOURCE · Qt 6 DESKTOP TOOL</p><h1 id="hero-title">让元件库转换，<em>顺手一点。</em></h1><p class="hero-lede">从 LCSC / EasyEDA 取回元件数据，整理成你熟悉的 EDA 库。少一点重复劳动，多一点真正的设计时间。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark magnetic" href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">下载稳定版 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#story">看看它如何工作 <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-facts"><span><b data-release-version>v3.1.11</b> 当前稳定版</span><span><b>GPL-3.0</b> 开源许可</span><span><b>GUI + CLI</b> 两种方式</span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-stage reveal reveal-delay" data-model-stage><div class="stage-note"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>LIVE MODEL STUDY</span><small>STEP / 3D</small></div><canvas id="model-canvas" aria-label="EasyKiConverter STEP 元件模型的交互式网页预览"></canvas><div class="model-fallback-copy" role="status">STEP 3D 预览暂不可用。页面内容和下载入口仍可正常使用。</div><div class="model-shadow" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="model-label label-top">3D MODEL <b>01</b></div><div class="model-label label-bottom">A quiet little solid<br><strong>ready to move.</strong></div><div class="stage-hint"><span class="drag-icon">↔</span> 滚动或移动指针试试</div></div>
      <a class="scroll-cue" href="#story" aria-label="继续向下"><span></span>继续向下</a>
    </section>
    <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>SYMBOL</span><i>✳</i><span>FOOTPRINT</span><i>✳</i><span>3D MODEL</span><i>✳</i><span>BOM</span><i>✳</i><span>GUI + CLI</span><i>✳</i><span>SYMBOL</span><i>✳</i><span>FOOTPRINT</span><i>✳</i><span>3D MODEL</span><i>✳</i></div></div>
    <section id="story" class="story section shell" aria-labelledby="story-title"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="kicker">THE QUIET MIDDLE</p><h2 id="story-title">数据在这里<br><em>找到自己的形状。</em></h2><p>EasyKiConverter 是一座安静的桥：左边接住 LCSC / EasyEDA，右边把能用的结果交还给 KiCad、Altium 和你的工作流。</p></div><div class="story-rail" data-story-rail><article class="story-card story-card-a reveal"><span class="story-index">01 / INPUT</span><h3>先把元件<br>带进来。</h3><p>输入 LCSC 编号，或直接导入 BOM。剪贴板里的编号也不用重新整理。</p><div class="story-pulse">C2040 <span>→</span></div></article><article class="story-card story-card-b reveal reveal-delay-1"><span class="story-index">02 / SHAPE</span><h3>符号、封装、<br>模型，一起准备。</h3><p>下载数据、映射图层、处理 3D 文件，批量操作交给多线程。</p><div class="story-stack"><b>SYMBOL</b><b>FOOTPRINT</b><b>3D MODEL</b></div></article><article class="story-card story-card-c reveal reveal-delay-2"><span class="story-index">03 / RETURN</span><h3>回到你的<br>设计里。</h3><p>输出完成后，继续在目标 EDA 中设计。工具不应该抢走你的注意力。</p><div class="story-check">✓ ready to use</div></article></div></section>
    <section class="product-showcase section shell" aria-labelledby="showcase-title"><div class="section-intro section-intro-wide reveal"><p class="kicker">THE REAL THING</p><h2 id="showcase-title">它不是概念图。<br><em>这是实际的工作台。</em></h2><p>来自 EasyKiConverter 主项目的真实 Qt Quick 界面：添加元件、导入 BOM、设定输出，然后开始转换。</p></div><figure class="app-window reveal"><div class="window-chrome"><span class="window-icon"><img src="assets/icons/easyki-icon.svg" alt=""></span><b>EasyKiConverter</b><span class="window-spacer"></span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><img src="assets/showcase/easykiconverter-main.webp" alt="EasyKiConverter 实际 Qt Quick 主界面，包含添加元件、BOM 和导出设置" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>REAL QT QUICK UI</span><span>来自主项目 resources/imgs/screenshot1.png</span></figcaption></figure></section>
    <section id="features" class="features section shell" aria-labelledby="features-title"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="kicker">A TOOL WITH GOOD MANNERS</p><h2 id="features-title">把繁琐的部分，<br><em>做得体面一点。</em></h2></div><p>功能都围绕真实的电子工程工作流展开：不假装替你设计，只替你省下机械操作。</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article id="formats" class="feature-card feature-card-large reveal"><span class="feature-number">01</span><div><h3>多目标输出</h3><p>稳定版以 KiCad、Altium 为主要目标；主项目持续扩展其他格式，具体能力以各版本 Release 和格式矩阵为准。</p><div class="format-pills"><b>KiCad</b><b>Altium</b><b>3D</b></div></div></article><article class="feature-card feature-card-mint reveal reveal-delay-1"><span class="feature-symbol">⌁</span><h3>批量而不吵闹</h3><p>BOM 导入、多线程处理和断点记忆，让大批量元件也保持清爽。</p></article><article class="feature-card feature-card-peach reveal reveal-delay-2"><span class="feature-symbol">◒</span><h3>看得见结果</h3><p>LCSC 预览图、转换状态和诊断信息，都在界面里保持可见。</p></article><article class="feature-card feature-card-lilac reveal"><span class="feature-symbol">⌘</span><h3>GUI + CLI</h3><p>想点选时有 Qt 6 界面，需要自动化时也有命令行。</p></article><article class="feature-card feature-card-yellow reveal reveal-delay-1"><span class="feature-symbol">↗</span><h3>不把设置忘掉</h3><p>配置自动保存，下次打开时从你熟悉的状态继续。</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="workflow" class="workflow section shell" aria-labelledby="workflow-title"><div class="workflow-copy reveal"><p class="kicker">A SMALL RITUAL</p><h2 id="workflow-title">四步，<br><em>然后回去设计。</em></h2><p>没有复杂的导入仪式。选择输入，选择目标，确认输出，继续你的板子。</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/blob/master/docs/user/GETTING_STARTED.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">阅读快速入门 ↗</a></div><ol class="steps reveal reveal-delay"><li><span>01</span><div><b>添加元件</b><p>粘贴 LCSC 编号，或导入 BOM 文件。</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><b>选择目标</b><p>选择需要的 EDA 输出和 3D 模型。</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><b>开始转换</b><p>数据获取、处理与写入由工作流完成。</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><b>继续设计</b><p>把生成的库带回你的 EDA 工具。</p></div></li></ol></section>
    <section class="platforms section shell" aria-labelledby="platforms-title"><div class="platform-intro reveal"><p class="kicker">WHERE IT LIVES</p><h2 id="platforms-title">你的系统，<br><em>它都认识。</em></h2><p>稳定版 Release 提供对应平台安装包；下载时请按设备架构选择资产。</p></div><div class="platform-list reveal reveal-delay"><div><b>Windows</b><span>x64 · ARM64</span><i>01</i></div><div><b>Linux</b><span>x86_64 · ARM64</span><i>02</i></div><div><b>macOS</b><span>Intel · Apple Silicon</span><i>03</i></div></div></section>
    <section id="download" class="download section shell" aria-labelledby="download-title"><div class="download-card reveal"><div class="download-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="download-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="download-copy"><p class="kicker">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p><h2 id="download-title">让下一块板，<br><em>早点开始。</em></h2><p>当前稳定版 <strong data-release-version>v3.1.11</strong> · 免费 · GPL-3.0</p><div class="download-actions"><a class="button button-light magnetic" data-release-link href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases/tag/v3.1.11" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">下载 v3.1.11 <span>↗</span></a><a class="download-link" href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看全部 Release</a></div><div class="download-links" aria-label="Release 入口"><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><b>Windows</b><span>x64 · ARM64</span></a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><b>Linux</b><span>x86_64 · ARM64</span></a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><b>macOS</b><span>Intel · Apple Silicon</span></a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><b>Release notes</b><span>SHA256 checksums ↗</span></a></div><small>官网不托管大型安装包；请在对应 Release 页面选择平台资产、阅读变更说明并核对 SHA256。若 GitHub API 不可用，页面保留稳定版回退信息。</small></div><div class="download-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>OPEN<br>SOURCE</span><b>✳</b><span>MADE FOR<br>ENGINEERS</span></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer shell"><div><a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="assets/icons/easyki-icon.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28"><span>EasyKiConverter</span></a><p>让元件库转换，顺手一点。</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/tree/master/docs" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Docs</a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter_Website" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">贡献</a><a href="https://github.com/EasyKiconverter/EasyKiConverter/issues" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Issues</a></div><p class="copyright">© EasyKiConverter · GPL-3.0</p></footer>
  <div class="egg-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <script>import "../js/app.ts";</script>
</body>
</html>
